      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Stop suggesting that certain ranks should be granted more of anything. This is not a competition. \nYou are not the first to suggest this and nobody should be justifying an increase in a simple limit that should have very little to no issues being near unlimited. \nThere were outlined concerns as to why the current limit exists, mostly back when there were only a few slots, but I do agree that it is a joke to sit by and not increase it again at this point for users that enjoy the feature. \nI imagine if they are listening to feedback that the limit would be increased when they release the UI update. That is assuming the avatar UI can finally mange and sort avatars properly it wont be an issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
