      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: I never said it was a competition.\nI only figured the 'more by rank' due to the fact that higher ranks have played more, and complain more about the lack of avatar slots. Never have I heard a visitor complain about lack of avatar slots.\nnot to mention there was no need to be rude in the first 2 sections of your reply",
