  "details": "OH I just had an idea a good one\nmaybe good not sure but it sounds good in my head\nso basically everyone wants more favourite slots except avi creators because then people won't go back to the world right?\nhowever as the biggest avatar simp you will ever see, I come across so many talented avatar creators to the point that my world favourites is almost filled with just avatar worlds; and I have spent 470+ hours in it (known user right now)\nso what if, as u ranked up u got more avatar slots? I think it could look like this:\nvisitor: 16\nnew user: 18\nuser: 20\nknown user: 24 (cuz it's way harder to get to)\ntrusted user: 30 (cuz it's the hardest to get to)",
